'''Empress' Excavation 5''' (女王の発掘調査５, ''Joō no Hakkutsu Chōsa 5'', '''Queen's Excavation 5''') is an [[Empress' Research]] map unlocked after clearing [[Empress' Excavation 4]]. Just like its predecessor, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Each stage has a different one-time reward, including [[Ancient Egg: N006 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N006]] in stage 4. It was added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].
{{Map Stars|1024}}

